title "Who may delete audit rows"
direction down

stmt: statement on audit_event
ask who: connected as?
app: SELECT and INSERT only | UPDATE, DELETE, TRUNCATE, DDL refused by privilege
purge: SELECT, INSERT and DELETE
ask trig: row trigger? | DELETE and habeas.audit_purge = on in this transaction
deleted [ok]: row deleted | any row
refuse [bad]: RAISE | audit_event is append-only
owner [dashed]: outside the guarantee | can drop or disable the triggers, skip them with session_replication_role

stmt -> who
who -> app : habeas_app: api, worker, console
who -> purge : habeas_purge: habeas purge
who -> owner [dashed] : owner or superuser
purge -> trig
trig -> deleted [ok] : yes
trig -> refuse [bad] : no
